# v2.34.1 — §4-validated ship-verdict (doc-only)

**Type**: doc-only release. No production code changes. Users on v2.34.0 do
not need to upgrade unless they want the §4-validated ship-verdict badge.

## What changed

`docs/lcsa-nax/lcsa-nax-phase1_5-ship-verdict.md` is updated with §4-strict
3-session re-bench data. The single-session shipping numbers from v2.34.0
are validated under subprocess-isolated multi-session methodology with §4
cooldowns (180s initial, 60s inter-shape, 90s inter-round CLI knob).

## §4 re-bench summary

- **Sessions**: 3 subprocess-isolated Python processes
- **Cooldowns**: 180s initial, 60s inter-shape, 90s inter-round
- **A/B/A pattern**: NAX-sparse (dispatcher, cache-HIT) → SDPA+bias → NAX-sparse
- **Runs per direction**: 5
- **Shapes**: 6 Phase 0 production clusters + 1 niche-representative
- **Smoke gate**: per-session correctness check before timing (NAX vs SDPA+bias)

