## v2.34.0 production code unchanged

The C++ extension, Python API, and integration patchers are bit-identical
to v2.34.0. The version bump exists to give callers a clean reference for
"the §4-validated ship envelope" vs "the original single-session
envelope" in their own dependency manifests.

